C*******************************************************************************
C			CalSimHydro Rice Model Main Input File
C
C*****************************************************************************
C                            File Description
C
C  *Listed below are all input  file names used when running CalSimHydro
C   
C  *Each file name has a maximum length of 100 characters
C  
C
C---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C   Scenario Name (to be used in Part F of pathnames in SV File
C---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  L2015A			 /SCENARIO
C---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C    FILE NAME                                      DESCRIPTION
C---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  .\3b_RiceAvg\Parameter.dat                     / 1: Input data file containing simulation parameters   
  .\3b_RiceAvg\RefET.dat			    / 2: Input data file containing Pan Evaporation Time series
  .\3b_RiceAvg\Precip.dat			    / 3: Input data file containing Precipitation Data
  .\3b_RiceAvg\UnitInfilt.dat		    / 4: Input data file containing Unit Infiltration Data
  .\3b_RiceAvg\LandUse.dat			    / 5: Input data file containing Historical Land Use data 
  RiceOutputNORM.dss             / 6:
  RiceOutput.dss	            / 7: Final Output DSS file  
C*******************************************************************************
C                         Model Simulation Period and Output
C
C   The following lists the simulation beginning time, ending time and time step length.  
C
C   BDT    ; Beginning simulation date and time. Use MM/DD/YYYY_hh:mm format. 
C             * Midnight is 24:00
C   EDT   ; Ending simulation date and time.  Use MM/DD/YYYY_hh:mm format. 
C            * Midnight is 24:00
C   CACHE   ; Cache size in terms of number of values stored for time series data output
C
C-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C       VALUE                   DESCRIPTION
C-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     10/31/1920_24:00           / BDT 
     09/30/2015_24:00           / EDT
     1MON                       / UNITT
     500000                     / CACHE
     0.65                        / NormFraction
C*******************************************************************************
C******************************************************************************
C******************************************************************************
C                         Physical System
C
C    NREGN  ; Number of sub-regions modeled in the system
C
C-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
C       VALUE                   DESCRIPTION
